<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-STIELIKE SACKED BY ALMERIA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STIELIKE SACKED BY ALMERIA.</headline>
<dateline>ALMERIA, Spain 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former German international Uli Stielike was sacked on Tuesday after less than three months as coach of Spanish second division club Almeria.</p>
<p>The former Real Madrid player, who had previously coached the Swiss national side and teams in the German and Swiss leagues, has been unable to halt the side's slide into the relegation zone.</p>
